"name": "Duck Typing",
"aliases": [
"Duck Typing"
],
"def": "Deciding whether an object can be used by checking that it has the methods being called, rather than by checking its class.",
"example": "A loop calls describe() on a Book, a DVD and a MobileLibraryVan; the van works because it has describe(), even though it has no shared parent.",
